OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABadenoch says proposed #10bn air
OL,4,Adefence system would be 'specific' to
OL,5,AUK threats as costs questioned
OL,6,
OL,7,FBadenoch told BBC Breakfast the
OL,8,Fprogramme could be paid for with #1bn
OL,9,Fearmarked every year for a decade, and
OL,10,Fpointed to her party having already set
OL,11,Fout savings in areas such as welfare
OL,12,Fand net zero
OL,14,FIn the past, experts have suggested
OL,15,Fsuch a system could cost #80bn over 10
OL,16,Fyears
OL,18,FLater, on Radio 4's Today programme,
OL,19,FBadenoch was asked if promises the
OL,20,FTories had made on defence and tax were
OL,21,F"fiscally responsible" - to which she
OL,22,Fsaid her party wasn't "messing around"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
