OL,3,ABadenoch says proposed #10bn air
OL,4,Adefence system would be 'specific' to
OL,5,AUK threats as costs questioned
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe also spoke about Reform voters,
OL,8,Fsaying she wants them to vote
OL,9,FConservative again but added that some
OL,10,Fof the party's politicians are "just
OL,11,Fnot our kind of people"
OL,13,FThe Conservative leader is in
OL,14,FBirmingham for her party's annual party
OL,15,Fconference - she is due to give her
OL,16,Fkeynote speech on Wednesday
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
