OL,3,AYemeni military says it has 'secured'
OL,4,ARed Sea waterway
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemeni pro-government forces backed by
OL,7,FSaudi Arabia say they have "secured"
OL,8,Fthe Bab al-Mandab Strait at the
OL,9,Fsouthern end of the Red Sea, at the
OL,10,Fstart of a major offensive against the
OL,11,FIran-backed Houthi movement.
OL,13,FThe Yemeni military also said in a
OL,14,Fstatement that its forces had captured
OL,15,Fthe Red Sea city of Mokha on Monday
OL,16,Fafternoon with the help of Saudi air
OL,17,Fstrikes.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1791280565
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AYemeni military says it has 'secured'
OL,4,ARed Sea waterway
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in conflicting reports, unnamed
OL,7,FYemeni government and military sources
OL,8,Flater told news agencies Reuters and
OL,9,FAFP that the forces had only reached
OL,10,Fthe city's outskirts.
OL,12,FThe Houthis denied losing Bab al-Mandab
OL,13,Fand Mokha and said they had struck
OL,14,FRiyadh's airport and other locations in
OL,15,FSaudi Arabia in retaliation for the air
OL,16,Fstrikes.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
