OL,3,AKenya confirms its first Ebola death as
OL,4,Aoutbreak spreads
OL,5,
OL,6,FKenya has confirmed its first case of
OL,7,FEbola - a Kenyan citizen who has been
OL,8,Fliving in the Democratic Republic of
OL,9,FCongo for the past seven years.
OL,11,FHealth Minister Aden Duale said the
OL,12,Fpatient, who fell ill a month ago, and
OL,13,Fwas treated in several hospitals in DR
OL,14,FCongo, died days after arriving in
OL,15,FNairobi.
OL,17,FDuale said the patient boarded a flight
OL,18,Fon Saturday and underwent normal public
OL,19,Fscreening at the main airport in
OL,20,FNairobi before he was transferred by a
OL,21,Frelative to a hospital in the city.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
